        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Pemko Nylon Brush Door Seal</b>\r\n<p>\r\nBrush gasketing products consist of dense type 6 nylon bristles. These gasketing products will conform to irregular surfaces making it an excellent product to seal almost any opening using a minimal closing force.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nCan be used to seal doors, windows, and more. Field sizable (cut to length).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe aluminum retainer housing is mortised into the face or edge. Requires 1/4\" deep by 1/4\" wide  groove. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Pemko 5025ANB Door Seal\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Aluminum Housing Depth: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Aluminum Housing Width: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Nylon Brush Seal: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Nylon Brush Color: Black</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 80\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually 80\" length</b>\r\n</p>",
